{"id":"en_i-shouldn-t-have-died-for-her-vanity","title":"I Shouldn’t Have Died for Her Vanity","titleEn":"I Shouldn’t Have Died for Her Vanity","description":"Olivia Brown lost her life to heatstroke in a previous existence, all because her roommate Isabella Hall would not permit her to turn on the air conditioner. Given a second chance after rebirth, Olivia seeks to change dormitories. Isabella, who has built an online following and income by presenting herself as someone enduring hardship, stirs up public sentiment in an attempt to force Olivia to remain. Olivia, however, counters using proof she had preserved, revealing the falsehoods behind Isabella’s act. Ultimately the facts surface, Isabella is removed from the school, and Olivia relocates to a different dorm, beginning life anew. Those interested can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-shouldnt-have-died-for-her-vanity/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-shouldnt-have-died-for-her-vanity/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Rebirth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dd7vy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-shouldn-t-have-died-for-her-vanity_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dd7vy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-shouldn-t-have-died-for-her-vanity_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dd7vy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-shouldn-t-have-died-for-her-vanity_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dd